  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program in Support of Mexico&apos;s Climate Change Agenda III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa en Apoyo a la Agenda de Cambio Climtico de Mxico III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Consolidar el marco institucional y operativo que sustenta la agenda de cambio climtico de Mxico, con la necesaria implementacin transversal de consideraciones de cambio climtico en las polticas pblicas (mainstreaming), as como impulsar la implementacin de instrumentos y medios necesarios de mitigacin y adaptacin al cambio climtico con base en un marco operativo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To consolidate of the institutional and operational framework that climate change agenda of Mexico, with the necessary cross implementation considerations of public policy (mainstreaming), climate change agenda as well as promote the implementation of instruments and means of mitigation and adaptation to climate change based on an operational framework.</narrative>
  </description>
